From 661ad66fb922b187be418fc9453dc8c6d7a11800 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:40:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4 M2: g6m4 runs ML4 on the TP4 ring; GR8_TEACHER_DUMP

- module_info: G6_MODEL_ID_ML4 (name ml4, caps MTP0); options.rs and engine_options.h treat GR8_MOE_TOPK as
  Flash-only for ML4 (its top-4 is routed in glue::k_router_plan_ml4)
- g6m4: GR8_QA_SPLIT / GR8_IDXQ_SPLIT off and refused for ML4 (no q_a; its replicated GEMVs are not split yet)
- GR8_TEACHER_DUMP=DIR (runtime/teacher_dump.h): offline teacher-forced scoring against a reference candidate list,
  per rank the vocab slice LSE, max, argmax, next-token logit and K candidate logits per row

Checked: M1 subset (layers 0,1,3,35,39) on the 4-box ring at chunk 4: every step line equal to m4sim and across ranks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
